@*
    Default-empty auth slot for the shared sticky navbar (_StylobotNavbar.cshtml).

    Renders NOTHING on the standalone FOSS dashboard: that surface has no auth controls
    in the navbar, and this default guarantees Html.PartialAsync("_NavbarAuthSlot") never
    throws when no surface-specific override exists.

    Surfaces that DO have auth (the marketing site, the commercial dashboard) ship their
    own Views/Shared/_NavbarAuthSlot.cshtml; Razor's view-location resolution prefers the
    local copy over this one, so their sign-in / account-menu / edit-mode controls render
    INSIDE the navbar's right-actions group (next to GitHub + the theme picker) rather than
    as a separate full-width strip below the sticky header.

    Keep this file empty. Do NOT add auth logic here — this is the FOSS no-op default.
*@
